Libraries, by role. Organizing: no sidecar of its own, holds no role, none of it participates in the cascade.

satlib, the resolver bin/ dispatches to, is prototyped here rather than installed here, for the same reason bin/ is: satx is becoming the new SAT prototype. Per SAT Sidecars: Config and Metadata v0.0.13, this is also where the language-neutral catalog template lives, lib/locale/sat.pot, once one is extracted; each language's translated catalog lives in that language's own archive instead, at {lang}/messages/ (see en/messages/).
